dashboard.definition:
{
	"title": "Cisco Spaces - Building Intelligence",
	"description": "Cisco Spaces device tracking, user presence, occupancy, and wireless intelligence",
	"inputs": {
		"input_global_trp": {
			"options": {
				"defaultValue": "-7d@h,now",
				"token": "global_time"
			},
			"title": "",
			"type": "input.timerange"
		}
	},
	"defaults": {
		"dataSources": {
			"ds.search": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
					}
				}
			},
			"ds.spl2": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
					}
				}
			}
		},
		"tokens": {
			"default": {}
		}
	},
	"visualizations": {
		"viz_about_bg": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_about_purpose": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "# Building Resilience — Cisco Spaces\n\nReal-time **location analytics, occupancy, and collaboration intelligence** from Cisco Spaces and Webex devices. Use this dashboard to monitor building utilization, track device presence, and assess workspace efficiency.\n\n**Audience:** Facilities Management, Workplace Services, IT Operations\n**Primary Sources:** Cisco Spaces (Location, Occupancy, Presence), Webex Device Telemetry\n**Refresh:** All panels follow the global time picker; Spaces data refreshes every 5–15 minutes\n\n---\n\n## How to Navigate This Dashboard\n\n**Cisco Spaces Overview** — Building hierarchy, device presence counts, SSID activity, and historical trends.\n*Start here — confirm location services are operational and occupancy is within expected bounds.*\n\n**Collaboration & Occupancy** — Webex device inventory, people counts, room utilization rates, and per-building summaries.\n*Use to assess workspace efficiency, plan capacity, and identify underutilized spaces.*\n\n> **Reading pattern:** Stable device counts and expected occupancy = normal. Sudden drops in presence or zero people counts = check Spaces integration or building access."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_about_sources": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Data Sources & Troubleshooting\n\n---\n\n**Cisco Spaces** — Cisco Spaces App for Splunk\nSourcetypes: `cisco:spaces:firehose` (DEVICE_LOCATION_UPDATE, USER_PRESENCE, SPACE_OCCUPANCY)\nFreshness: ~5 min\n\n**Webex Devices** — Cisco Webex Add-on for Splunk\nSourcetypes: `cisco:webex:devices`, `cisco:webex:telemetry`\nFreshness: ~15 min\n\n---\n\n**Panel showing \"No results\"?**\n\n1. **Widen the time range** — Spaces data may need 4+ hours to populate\n2. **Verify the Spaces App is installed** — check *Manage Apps*\n3. **Confirm Firehose data** — run `index=* sourcetype=cisco:spaces:firehose | head 5`\n4. **Check Webex integration** — verify Webex device telemetry is flowing."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_box_kpi": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_location": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_rooms": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_trends": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_webex": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_wireless": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_device_building_bar": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_device_by_building"
			},
			"description": "Network device count per building from Cisco Spaces",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Devices by Building",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_device_presence_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotation_occupancy_spike",
				"primary": "ds_device_presence_trend"
			},
			"description": "Device presence by city over time",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": [
					"#D64550"
				],
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#6EBE4A"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Active devices by location",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_hdr_kpi": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Real-Time KPIs"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_location": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Location Intelligence"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_rooms": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Room Occupancy"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_trends": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Presence Trends"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_webex": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Webex Collaboration"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_wireless": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Wireless Intelligence"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_collab": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Collaboration & Occupancy Tab\n\n---\n\n**Webex Device Inventory** — All Webex devices with model, location, serial, and people count\n**Webex People Count Trend** — People detected by Webex devices over time\n\n---\n\n**Room Occupancy Detail** — Per-room capacity, peak count, presence, and utilization percentage\n**Room Utilization by Building** — Aggregate occupancy summary per building"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Cisco Spaces Overview Tab\n\n---\n\n**Connected Devices** — Unique device MAC addresses tracked via DEVICE_LOCATION_UPDATE\n**Active Users** — Latest active user count from USER_PRESENCE events\n**Rooms Occupied** — Rooms with detected people presence from SPACE_OCCUPANCY events\n**Active SSIDs** — Distinct SSIDs with active client associations\n**Webex Devices** — Total Webex devices reporting via WEBEX_TELEMETRY\n\n---\n\n**Location Breakdown** — Campus → Building → Floor hierarchy with device counts\n**Device Presence Trend** — Device location update volume over time\n**SSID Client Trend** — Client count per SSID over time\n**Building Occupancy Trend** — Occupancy levels per building over time"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_kpi_devices": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_devices"
			},
			"description": "Unique network devices detected across Cisco Spaces locations",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent"
			},
			"title": "Connected Devices",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_occupancy": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_building_occupancy"
			},
			"description": "Rooms currently occupied based on Webex device sensors",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent"
			},
			"title": "Rooms Occupied",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_ssids": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_ssids"
			},
			"description": "Number of SSIDs with active client associations",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent"
			},
			"title": "Active SSIDs",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_users": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_users"
			},
			"description": "Unique users detected via wireless association or presence",
			"options": {
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineDisplay": "off",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent"
			},
			"title": "Active Users",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_kpi_users_chart": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_users"
			},
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"chartShowLabels": false,
				"dataValuesDisplay": "off",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Daily Trend",
			"type": "splunk.column"
		},
		"viz_kpi_webex": {
			"context": {
				"trendColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 0,
						"value": "#6E6E6E"
					},
					{
						"from": 0,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_webex_count"
			},
			"description": "Webex collaboration devices reporting to Control Hub",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#049FD9",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showSparklineAreaGraph": true,
				"showSparklineTooltip": true,
				"showTrendIndicator": true,
				"sparklineAreaColor": "#049FD9",
				"sparklineDisplay": "below",
				"sparklineStrokeColor": "#049FD9",
				"trendColor": "> trendValue | rangeValue(trendColorEditorConfig)",
				"trendDisplay": "percent"
			},
			"title": "Webex Devices",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_location_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_location_breakdown"
			},
			"description": "Hierarchical view of all managed locations with device and user counts",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 20,
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"headerBackgroundColor": "#F5F5F5",
					"headerColor": "#2B2B2B",
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(tableAltRowBackgroundColorsByBackgroundColor)"
				},
				"fontSize": "small"
			},
			"title": "Location Breakdown — Campus / Building / Floor",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_narr_collab": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "**Collaboration room utilization and people counts** from Webex devices and Cisco Spaces sensors. Use this tab to assess workspace efficiency and plan capacity."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_narr_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "Real-time **location analytics and occupancy** from Cisco Spaces. Use this tab to monitor device presence, building hierarchy, and historical occupancy across all facilities."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_p_hdr_bg": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.88)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_p_hdr_title": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#005073",
				"fontSize": "large",
				"markdown": "## Cisco Spaces - Building Intelligence"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_room_detail_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_room_detail"
			},
			"description": "Per-room occupancy with building, floor, and device info",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 20,
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"headerBackgroundColor": "#F5F5F5",
					"headerColor": "#2B2B2B",
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(tableAltRowBackgroundColorsByBackgroundColor)"
				},
				"fontSize": "small"
			},
			"title": "Room Occupancy Detail",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_rooms_summary": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_rooms"
			},
			"description": "Rooms used vs total per building",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#E5A823"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Room utilization by building",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_section_collab": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.45)",
				"fillOpacity": 1,
				"rx": 12,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_section_overview": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.45)",
				"fillOpacity": 1,
				"rx": 12,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_ssid_clients_bar": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_ssid_clients"
			},
			"description": "Client count breakdown by SSID — which networks are busiest",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#8B6FC9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "SSID Client Breakdown",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_ssid_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_ssid_trend"
			},
			"description": "SSID client association count trending over time",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "SSID Association Trend",
			"type": "splunk.line"
		},
		"viz_user_presence_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotation_occupancy_spike",
				"primary": "ds_user_presence_trend"
			},
			"description": "User presence by city over time",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": [
					"#D64550"
				],
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#6EBE4A"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Active users by location",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_webex_building_bar": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_webex_by_building"
			},
			"description": "Device count per building from Webex telemetry",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Webex devices by building",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_webex_people_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_webex_people_trend"
			},
			"description": "Webex sensor people count by city",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#6EBE4A"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "People detected by location",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_webex_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_webex_devices"
			},
			"description": "Webex devices with model, location, and connectivity status",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 20,
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"headerBackgroundColor": "#F5F5F5",
					"headerColor": "#2B2B2B",
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(tableAltRowBackgroundColorsByBackgroundColor)"
				},
				"fontSize": "small"
			},
			"title": "Webex Device Inventory",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_kpi_devices_chart": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"chartShowLabels": false,
				"dataValuesDisplay": "off",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"type": "splunk.column",
			"title": "Daily Trend",
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_devices"
			}
		},
		"viz_kpi_ssids_chart": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"chartShowLabels": false,
				"dataValuesDisplay": "off",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"type": "splunk.column",
			"title": "Daily Trend",
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_kpi_ssids"
			}
		},
